#: docs/silkie/font-protocol.rst:133
msgid "Relays and multiplexers"
msgstr "中继与多路复用器"

#: docs/silkie/font-protocol.rst:135
msgid ""
"A relay that passes bytes through can forward this extension. A multiplexer that rebuilds the "
"screen must retain and replay the font attributes and only advertise ``font.1`` when it can do "
"so. Applications query support and retain ordinary text rendering as their fallback."
msgstr "透传字节的中继可以转发此扩展。重建屏幕的多路复用器必须保留并重放字体属性，且仅在具备这一能力时公布 ``font.1``。应用应查询支持情况，并保留普通文本渲染作为回退方案。"


# Installer and Extended-width defaults.
msgid "Silkie uses Iosevka's wider Extended faces by default, including automatic bold and italic variants, with Iosevka Slab for the ``serif`` role. The :doc:`installer <install>` includes Iosevka and its SIL Open Font License notice. Install additional families from `Iosevka's releases <https://github.com/be5invis/Iosevka/releases>`_. Fonts are selected from the local system; the protocol does not transmit font files. If a family is absent, normal platform font substitution applies."
msgstr "Silkie 默认使用 Iosevka 较宽的 Extended 字形，自动选择的粗体和斜体也采用相同字宽；``serif`` 角色使用 Iosevka Slab。:doc:`安装脚本 <install>` 包含 Iosevka 字体及其 SIL 开源字体许可证声明。其他字体族可从 `Iosevka 发布页 <https://github.com/be5invis/Iosevka/releases>`_ 安装。字体从本地系统中选择，协议不传输字体文件。字体族缺失时，使用平台的正常字体替代机制。"
